# High-conflict tracking docs — every session appends to these at the same
# anchor (top of the chronological log / Open section / At-a-glance table),
# so parallel sessions always conflict on a plain rebase. `merge=union`
# auto-takes both sides; the rebasing session then re-sorts dated headers
# and dedupes any at-a-glance rows in the same PR.
# See: new-engineering-session-instructions.md §7.4.
engineering-history.md          merge=union
engineering-history-archive.md  merge=union
roadmap.md                      merge=union
bugs.md                         merge=union
manual-actions.md               merge=union

# sauce.ai/signal tracking docs — same rationale, scoped to the signal/ folder.
signal/engineering-history.md          merge=union
signal/engineering-history-archive.md  merge=union
signal/roadmap.md                      merge=union
signal/bugs.md                         merge=union
signal/manual-actions.md               merge=union
